From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:27:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: show the address-bar hint in the sheet pill on the new
 tab page

On the new tab page the url bar text is empty, so the morphing origin
pill fell back to the tab spec and showed chrome-native://newtab/, and
the parked pill was blank. NTP, chrome://, chrome-native:// and about:
pages now use the bar text if it is not a raw internal URL, then the
bar hint, then the page title. Normal pages still show the host.
---
 .../browser/bare/BareVerticalTabsDrawer.java  | 136 ++++++++++++------
 .../bare/BareVerticalTabsDrawerUnitTest.java  |  70 +++++++++
 2 files changed, 164 insertions(+), 42 deletions(-)

